        "created_at": "2023-04-18T02:08:48.162Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My understanding is when it has a bracket you have to choose an option during creation.  If it’s not in brackets then when you use the ability in gameplay you get to choose whether it’s a hinder or boost when used.</p>",
